A bunch of things just occured to me:
one of the possible luckstone positions must have a flintstone
one of the possible luckstone positions must have a luckstone
one of the possible luckstone positions must have a loadstone
one of the possible luckstone positions must be empty
the luckstone cannot be in the same possible luckstone position as the
loadstone

Therefore, one of the positions will be empty, another will have a
luckstone, and another will have a loadstone and a flint stone.
Figuring out where the luckstone is becomes trivial.

If I made any incorrect assumptions, point them out.



